&lt;p&gt;QUETTA: A local court in Quetta on Saturday rejected the bail application of Islamabad-based journalist Shahid Maitla.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The bail application was filed by Rahib Buledi Advocate and other lawyers in the court of Judicial Magistrate-VII.&lt;/p&gt;
